  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with our exquisite custom quilt, where Norse mythology meets cozy comfort. Crafted for both durability and style, this quilt features a detailed Celtic Tree of Life design with a striking raven within a Celtic knot frame. Designed by Jeminise, this piece is perfect for adding a touch of ancient symbol meaning to your guest bedroom, or giving as a thoughtful, personalized gift for holidays, anniversaries, and birthdays.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Design:</strong> Personalization options may include size selection, custom text, or optional matching pillowcases to create a truly unique set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Celtic Artwork:</strong> Features a high-confidence visible design of a raven within a Celtic knot frame, highlighting the iconic Tree of Life and Norse mythology themes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Built with a breathable soft outer fabric layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for year-round comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 in), Twin (68x86 in), Full (80x90 in), Queen (90x90 in), and King (102x91 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal as a bed quilt, a cozy sofa throw, a backyard picnic mat, or a warm companion for camping trips.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Viking-05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Viking Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Viking Decor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Viking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw/Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Dry Clean Only, Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
